#: scenario7:scenario7_090A51F1_861C_4F72_B0D5_474947B3F7E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4d7d7c95e7c802c066c38ce5629a61840c4f2e43778c6f932168d7770b3ffaa
#. default-sha256: d98862fbf21e95f2183420f660f42dbce2fbd1ed2b59c5742e7ea494ea400408
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_090A51F1_861C_4F72_B0D5_474947B3F7E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫...And so, my life came to an end."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫………これが、⟪k:23⟫私の終わりだ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_5D8C55D5_BF96_41AE_A46B_B7820CB71569
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9bd5e94e1df4d14950e2ba6f1b0a9aa6161299717b8a2751bf02572baf00cea9
#. default-sha256: a3c90be908ebe8c357febb3379ad6ce9fdd30dceff00957e685b4acfc42dd952
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5D8C55D5_BF96_41AE_A46B_B7820CB71569"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But that wasn’t the end of the story."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫けれど、⟪k:1⟫まだ……すべてではない。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_C51746E0_7E56_4329_86EF_EDB666693DA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9558cfb8fbf0f53199a758e1996d444978af0951ca16de00ffeaf7530a1ab2a6
#. default-sha256: 81439ca9a5cd2180f37fb7e7cd595bef61c74d0f959581af946862e4f1d5b17b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C51746E0_7E56_4329_86EF_EDB666693DA2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I don’t know if what comes next could be called “my” story,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but memories of these "
"events linger in my soul."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それを、⟪k:1⟫私の続きであると呼べるのか定かではないけれど……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫私には魂の記憶が残ってい"
"る。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3DE6F1A1_7E45_4823_BB18_DFE93D6A6332
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a2b2ede82e8894d12a983112b36313f60616930d30250051aaa21b4965fe115
#. default-sha256: 27085b13fd96f7840af713fed217b6011e90d2c71914d1565b59ccad3c05f283
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3DE6F1A1_7E45_4823_BB18_DFE93D6A6332"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫How could I have ever imagined...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫that I would be made to witness my own misery "
"even in death?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫果たして誰が……、⟪k:1⟫命を失っても尚、⟪k:2⟫絶望的な光景を見せつけられ続けると予想できただろう"
"か……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8C20439B_C5B4_4D4A_AFAB_5CCD52C9ED90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 815cfebfab8b310bc17d76382a2d34231e2c63a0fb1c28413e06dd3f767da1e3
#. default-sha256: ab005cec92c3ee8649bc957f4457a9167bd7ba61b4676c74a8045fc7ff6995ad
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8C20439B_C5B4_4D4A_AFAB_5CCD52C9ED90"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And my soul—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫evidently still bound to my flesh—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私の肉体とその魂は、⟪k:1⟫未だに結びつきがあるというのか――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫拒絶の意志はかなわず、"
"⟪k:4⟫吸い寄せられるように……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A3D92C5D_C2DD_4CE0_8512_FCF7FE870B04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d526f4c3d4f3f7c4a8da1c35252af9536c4d47a577290480f84d153ea8d4c69
#. default-sha256: 60cdf325b23395fbe4eb77ad9c1e2d3ad3d90a8222be4ca598eacead65043675
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A3D92C5D_C2DD_4CE0_8512_FCF7FE870B04"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫was dragged along with it, against my will, down to the nearby village."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫自分自身の死体と共に、⟪k:1⟫村へと向かっていた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E61D0C8B_E817_4C49_8BCD_986BDDA99580
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 563c75d6adffdfac7a0e1bc0897f3987d362497bbba65077ab807307db0319f6
#. default-sha256: 86ee393de025bd0ccac8ec0a1c2549d5d3598fb29a71f5032d13c518b0dcfc0c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E61D0C8B_E817_4C49_8BCD_986BDDA99580"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The knights have returned from their holy quest!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫騎士の方々がご帰還なされたぞ！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4BC5D94C_29C0_4512_8464_CFCAC63C2BC4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ff8d3c6bb4623c2117807eecc7860e6a3f971499e733ba97e7035571d892a31
#. default-sha256: ebf091c24f378c2f3723efb980efd930f9051c70594bd6979613dd35c80b29e1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4BC5D94C_29C0_4512_8464_CFCAC63C2BC4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, how we’ve awaited your arrival!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ああ騎士様！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CB3ED887_927B_45F4_AD8F_4F1D0214AA0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 086f5864edc1a1e5e2e6defc6158f6e7f3a8d460afdec2c7ab940317ce75e6de
#. default-sha256: e666a7e0cf46872931d511494c63bbecc624f77c29466c648f914958acd206e8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CB3ED887_927B_45F4_AD8F_4F1D0214AA0F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫How glorious it is to see you!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫お待ちしておりました！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_1E29A1D1_0BEE_452D_97A6_C04B078CD2D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 325ebf31ec7638109ea143e5bebf2bc65faaf61af520730bf603d4a1630a1030
#. default-sha256: 420c3bc92619b23334f6d79e2bf5ff5fd59a13a70000c4970df3fd4246ca96ca
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1E29A1D1_0BEE_452D_97A6_C04B078CD2D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Waiting for us there was a cluster of villagers.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A large cross lay on the ground in "
"the center of the square."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私たちを迎えたのは、⟪k:1⟫広場に集まった村の民たちだった。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫その中央には巨大な十字架が"
"横たわっている。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A1924AEC_E6D6_462F_BDE5_51024E31F01B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e6bd0d4cc4607215f2739d2cbd13365c38ef7ed1bdff1a702aa66f7636a9ff5
#. default-sha256: 21f0e714b31af6ac2425252946f3367bda0f0ab512b4858dc3f107dccc87f514
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A1924AEC_E6D6_462F_BDE5_51024E31F01B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Holding torches, they formed a crowd around the knights, several of them familiar faces."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫騎士たちを取り囲む、⟪k:1⟫松明を手にした民衆には、⟪k:2⟫見覚えのある顔もいくらかあった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_F52A9436_A594_40DB_8213_25E1D487198D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68e543b595135d85f878307bf7ef63f5360e387afdd01b00ffac251c2734593b
#. default-sha256: 78bc19e8d9abfc9dfc10f69d13ce75968137e6ff02b6fa2af537b9828f0cb6fa
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F52A9436_A594_40DB_8213_25E1D487198D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No longer shall we live in fear of the curse befalling us!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eternal peace is assured!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫これでもう、⟪k:1⟫村に呪いが降りかかることはない！⟪k:2⟫　この村は永遠の平穏を約束されたのだ！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_16B2FCE2_C477_4BD9_8C7D_E88D8A4AF579
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82633c958527e468a677920990837cf73b3704648931e3087dce4a0406a7b564
#. default-sha256: da47fc7b82be56b0389b474ba3754d448182ead9ad2c5795f8b7f74c08e0f6f8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_16B2FCE2_C477_4BD9_8C7D_E88D8A4AF579"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why, then... ⟪k:1⟫were they acting like I was at fault?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫なのに、⟪k:1⟫どうして……すべてが私の所為になるのだろう。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4CEDA84C_E7DE_4F7A_8E6C_4075FF9ED2EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3231a5ecdf1e37c758afe5094c939966d7d93cb8427e9e6fd0198d8f81a7c76d
#. default-sha256: 606ee7e81db5f7c64165f18d2067bc6715e55972ad9f4c2c4086b2821fec186c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4CEDA84C_E7DE_4F7A_8E6C_4075FF9ED2EC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why was I the sinner, and why did I need to be judged?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どうして私に罪があり、⟪k:1⟫どうして私が裁かれなければならないのだろう。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2A266E31_4BB9_464A_9B6B_7551BF55087C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08b6c11b90aa68724474b66de3763f6bce3a6342ccbd58c77c495a5dae0b4dc2
#. default-sha256: e1cae99a8392f8a4a6aa9098c03333ca2b1a9835e6540a5a09e9f337da3a03e7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2A266E31_4BB9_464A_9B6B_7551BF55087C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My soul trembled at the overwhelming fervor consuming the crowd, ⟪k:1⟫their zealous desire "
"to see judgment cast."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫魔女を裁くという異様な熱気に包まれた中――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫私の心は震えていた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4055B4D2_8A2F_48DF_801C_6AA7C0D5ADC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ada3362003fc6ecee155a414f123862a6ddac20c6afb89c577c69823fd54c01
#. default-sha256: deb80ca6060e219aa24f76554cf97e9d5c749e7815307de2e9c80295480c6580
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4055B4D2_8A2F_48DF_801C_6AA7C0D5ADC8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Please don’t do this, Didier...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Please, hear my voice..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫兄さん……、⟪k:1⟫お願いです、⟪k:2⟫やめてください……。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫私の声を聞いてください……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_90CACC1B_FB5C_4F6A_A11B_C62ACBF86CA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16d22fa2f98957fcd2f0fc7532e0424e396339baed48240e28711f5fea7163a2
#. default-sha256: 0701fa3c06d00b45f701ceb5dba73a82b8b9923d559ed56dfc5cacd671a85ba4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_90CACC1B_FB5C_4F6A_A11B_C62ACBF86CA5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Please, tell me ⟪k:1⟫you⟪k:2⟫, at least, don’t think I did those things..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫兄さん、⟪k:1⟫どうか、⟪k:2⟫分かってください……。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫貴方だけは、⟪k:5⟫分かってください……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_1809491C_BCB6_4470_BD73_A9E1B6453A66
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2efc93b3b8ad2f1c1e2154e3ba02feef2df83949ae447acd78cb5aee46be2338
#. default-sha256: ad47115459a9fcfa669b89a66703cd394685d33092411307606bc69e5774df2c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1809491C_BCB6_4470_BD73_A9E1B6453A66"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Don’t put me on that cross...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If it was Mother who sold me out to the Church,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私の死体を十字架になど掲げないでください……。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫母が私を魔女として教会に売り渡したのな"
"ら――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_748FDB2D_891F_4063_B06B_CA7A27FC96BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ba8295876e373aaf4d53ab55a16ee2e2de38bc2aebdec4f29ee10ac06df04d23
#. default-sha256: 44972b386ecee594eef3252922593f8842fd9598e713f294f1e4a9c7f47da517
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_748FDB2D_891F_4063_B06B_CA7A27FC96BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The nails and rope for the crucifixion are here.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We would have you, O knight, "
"deliver the Lord’s judgment unto this vile witch!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫磔の鉄釘と荒縄は、⟪k:1⟫こちらに準備しております。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫騎士様……、⟪k:4⟫どうかあなたの手"
"で、⟪k:5⟫その魔女に最後の裁きを！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FE7C6CF8_459E_46AF_AA1C_47F64264FA6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb28d408d2981e256978b4fe00ab595908ae6230bcbb396f4932308ad88e27b5
#. default-sha256: a68b8783e23b5c8486ccc6fc8bb60b4cb473951eb6bf21f6c2ab035eb31844a2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FE7C6CF8_459E_46AF_AA1C_47F64264FA6A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Didier..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……兄さん……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_83319B1E_A3C6_4451_9E94_294CD95D46DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ea31dd686bfd634d7ade5054e361e532713e717a78b8a5833c63a19e7ef2743
#. default-sha256: d1b17d85119bdcfde1767e9e3f7015baf8333f114f5af2e6ffb290bcb8fc39cc
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_83319B1E_A3C6_4451_9E94_294CD95D46DE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Crucifixion!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫十字架を！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4307D535_FE8B_4BE6_BCDC_93F1F1C3CF34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ea31dd686bfd634d7ade5054e361e532713e717a78b8a5833c63a19e7ef2743
#. default-sha256: d1b17d85119bdcfde1767e9e3f7015baf8333f114f5af2e6ffb290bcb8fc39cc
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4307D535_FE8B_4BE6_BCDC_93F1F1C3CF34"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Crucify it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫十字架を！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BE5EED1B_42A0_45A3_A6C7_15DD67C76C1B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c724f7a82b2a658c8059096fc29d24d4d594bb819e9b06554c164fc729cfd20
#. default-sha256: 23f6b5a8629a64d3106638b8f6f6209ac993f4e7d5f194bc03cc611bae95cfe5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BE5EED1B_42A0_45A3_A6C7_15DD67C76C1B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My brother lowered my corpse to the ground and began removing my clothing, ⟪k:1⟫and in that "
"very moment, I realized the purpose of hanging someone from a cross."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……兄は私の死体を地面に下ろすと、⟪k:1⟫私の衣服に手をかけた。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫十字架にかけるという意味"
"を、⟪k:4⟫その瞬間はっきりと理解し――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B88FDF38_E3ED_4B5C_B13B_53B336DCF166
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57774f59e3e373da369d340a40f98afe3537ba4dbe6cd99219b3583fa5729919
#. default-sha256: ce548272ac4b0e9481563c9ed0315bd26640bbf8679760ef9f2038d132ede618
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B88FDF38_E3ED_4B5C_B13B_53B336DCF166"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Overwhelmed by hopelessness, tears streamed down my face."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あまりの絶望に、⟪k:1⟫私の涙は、⟪k:2⟫止まらなかった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_F330EC48_B442_43BB_867C_F9A5674ECE91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b57e919f65142b1b3bdf8b3c0a4f7e94d2be653655c5f99ca2ddd93578ff28e
#. default-sha256: f4d4ba3ccc199c729f1bd469654217a7c25eadda02559a7982e1bce8e53b179a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F330EC48_B442_43BB_867C_F9A5674ECE91"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫don’t do it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……やめてください……！！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BFF95DC4_C5B9_4167_A118_3B8955B2FC84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ef1430f45f67573dd0a431396507f5626c7e46c30a653cce81aa110b2d1ae7a
#. default-sha256: 09d90ea581c225a18b30b1cab0ebfdc93376fd78a8e3ec3e2397af4581daa7bc
